      "name": "Inspire Artistry",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The servant of the vine selects up to 6 creatures within 50 feet and grants them advantage to Dexterity (Acrobatics), Dexterity (Sleight of Hand), or Charisma (Performance) checks. The servant of the vine chooses which skill for each recipient."
      ],
      "uses": {
        "count": 3,
        "period": "day",
        "display": "3/Day"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Spellcasting",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The servant of the vine is an 11th-level spellcaster. Its primary spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 14, +6 to hit with spell attacks). It has the following cleric spells prepared:",
        "Cantrips (at will): guidance, light, sacred flame, thaumaturgy",
        "1st level (4 slots): bless, create or destroy water (creates or destroys wine; wine created this way evaporates after 1 day), cure wounds, sanctuary",
        "2nd level (3 slots): hold person, lesser restoration, protection from poison",
        "3rd level (3 slots): bestow curse, dispel magic",
        "4th level (3 slots): guardian of faith, freedom of movement",
        "5th level (2 slots): contagion",
        "6th level (1 slot): harm, heal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Multiattack",
      "category": "action",
